<description>&lt;p&gt;The government has broadened its BIR rapid-intervention force around Lake Chad and is using drones and joint border patrols to target Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest, where attacks on troops persist. Government troops killed four suspected separatists after a village attack and suspended Issa Tchiroma’s party for three months. An army vehicle hit a landmine near the Cameroon border, killing eight soldiers, and attacks on police in Fundong injured three people. 231 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1zRi14TlJJQ1VsVDdGemlzV2poSjBwbkR2VFI3T1N6bmE1b3FXazVveGtCQmFwSGxzZlZDMnNkc0xrYVFGUExqX0hwaVpmV0M2NXYtcU5YdV9JcVM1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOeXprSkVGSVd2UHlmZW04RUZlSzBCQ0s5cURWelduU0ZpRlRpZm1PT3VmZDZ1SDdhWTcwYWd5Q09KS20zWW9tMDlxQUhxSkNXNlM4WmFzYkU2SnV6U0RkZkIyV2dUc3ozWnlRMG5RU2Q0OGR0N092MTVOSHRwUk56bTVfWGFKTGZGbFBOLXVVa3htRmVNeXNOVW04by16OTN6YnBjV1ZlWHR1SWhzOVMxb3JLTG9TMy01MkxycWpyY2Etbk9IZEJUaGg4RE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQNm9jNzg4bm9XcEVaRFhPNGZBYWVUOFpuYzVkdFhpMjdJYUpVVTlBMUg3SEc0NEV2Z0FFZDYzUVRSUXRiRkVUbVZKb0RvVkcwLVFabXVQbTNTd1Z1OWhNeDNHSDR5TDJpM1d0WDRNSHJUZ0Y4NWN6dzgyVGtnLTZEM1ZBblhoN3JGZkJfRGxOWlM1OV9LekE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News &amp;amp; Headlines – Australian Broadcasting Corporation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa Intelligence&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPR25RUkxaczlEZnV4QkZMYllQei1fV3pFRWpmcXhRdXFiWFR4NVY2MjItenh2RzBhVjBqT1ZlVUhrbU1vR2pGUkM3TUlXYUZCVjN5MFJ4ZWtZcndJUVRyMGJFNU